WEBVTT

00:00:03.217 --> 00:00:05.409
FRIENDSHIP AND BRAVERY.

00:00:05.453 --> 00:00:07.934
AND, HARRY,
JUST BE CAREFUL.

00:00:45.406 --> 00:00:46.668
YOU?

00:00:47.974 --> 00:00:50.715
NO, IT CAN'T BE.

00:00:50.759 --> 00:00:52.413
SNAPE--HE WAS THE ONE--

00:00:52.456 --> 00:00:55.677
YES, HE DOES SEEM
THE TYPE, DOESN'T HE?

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:57.722
NEXT TO HIM,
WHO WOULD SUSPECT

00:00:57.766 --> 00:01:02.075
P-P-POOR, ST-T-TUTTERING
PROFESSOR QUIRRELL?

00:01:02.118 --> 00:01:04.512
BUT--BUT THAT DAY,

00:01:04.555 --> 00:01:06.731
DURING THE QUIDDITCH MATCH,

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:08.037
SNAPE TRIED TO KILL ME.

00:01:08.081 --> 00:01:09.952
NO, DEAR BOY.

00:01:09.996 --> 00:01:11.736
I TRIED TO KILL YOU,

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:13.260
AND TRUST ME,

00:01:13.303 --> 00:01:14.783
IF SNAPE'S CLOAK
HADN'T CAUGHT FIRE

00:01:14.826 --> 00:01:16.437
AND BROKEN
MY EYE CONTACT,

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.743
I WOULD HAVE SUCCEEDED.

00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:19.875
EVEN WITH SNAPE

00:01:19.919 --> 00:01:21.964
MUTTERING HIS LITTLE
COUNTER-CURSE.

00:01:22.008 --> 00:01:24.445
SNAPE WAS TRYING
TO SAVE ME?

00:01:24.488 --> 00:01:26.926
I KNEW YOU WERE A DANGER
TO ME RIGHT FROM THE OFF,

00:01:26.969 --> 00:01:28.840
ESPECIALLY AFTER HALLOWEEN.

00:01:28.884 --> 00:01:32.061
TH-THEN YOU LET
THE TROLL IN.

00:01:32.105 --> 00:01:34.411
VERY GOOD, POTTER. YES.

00:01:34.455 --> 00:01:37.632
SNAPE, UNFORTUNATELY,
WASN'T FOOLED.

00:01:37.675 --> 00:01:39.677
WHILE EVERYONE ELSE WAS
RUNNING ABOUT THE DUNGEON,

00:01:39.721 --> 00:01:42.028
HE WENT TO THE THIRD FLOOR
TO HEAD ME OFF.

00:01:43.768 --> 00:01:45.335
HE, OF COURSE,

00:01:45.379 --> 00:01:47.598
NEVER TRUSTED ME AGAIN.

00:01:47.642 --> 00:01:50.993
HE RARELY LEFT ME ALONE.

00:01:51.037 --> 00:01:53.778
BUT HE DOESN'T
UNDERSTAND.

00:01:53.822 --> 00:01:55.911
I'M NEVER ALONE.

00:01:55.955 --> 00:01:58.000
NEVER.

00:01:58.044 --> 00:01:59.741
NOW...

00:01:59.784 --> 00:02:01.699
WHAT DOES THIS MIRROR DO?

00:02:03.832 --> 00:02:06.052
I SEE WHAT I DESIRE.

00:02:06.095 --> 00:02:09.359
I SEE MYSELF
HOLDING THE STONE.

00:02:09.403 --> 00:02:11.840
BUT HOW DO I GET IT?

00:02:11.883 --> 00:02:13.363
[WHISPERING]
Use the boy.

00:02:13.407 --> 00:02:16.279
COME HERE, POTTER!

00:02:16.323 --> 00:02:17.889
NOW!

00:02:29.858 --> 00:02:31.207
TELL ME.

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:33.079
WHAT DO YOU SEE?

00:02:59.105 --> 00:03:01.194
WHAT IS IT?
WHAT DO YOU SEE?

00:03:01.237 --> 00:03:05.328
I-I'M SHAKING HANDS
WITH DUMBLEDORE.

00:03:05.372 --> 00:03:07.287
I'VE WON THE HOUSE CUP.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.940
HE LIES.

00:03:08.984 --> 00:03:11.073
TELL THE TRUTH!

00:03:11.117 --> 00:03:13.075
WHAT DO YOU SEE?!

00:03:13.119 --> 00:03:15.991
LET ME SPEAK TO HIM.

00:03:16.035 --> 00:03:17.601
MASTER, YOU ARE NOT
STRONG ENOUGH.

00:03:17.645 --> 00:03:18.871
I HAVE STRENGTH
ENOUGH FOR THIS.

